# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .env.example — copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# cp .env.example .env
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SECRET_KEY=                         # Required. Run: openssl rand -hex 32
ALGORITHM=                          # Required. e.g. HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY_IN_MINUTES=     # Required. e.g. 30
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY_IN_DAYS=       # Required. e.g. 7
PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN_EXPIRY_IN_DAYS=# Required. e.g. 1
ENVIRONMENT=                        # Required. development | production | testing

# ── Database ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=                       # Required. e.g. postgresql://user:pass@localhost/dbname
TEST_DATABASE_URL=                  # Optional. Only needed for running tests

# ── Cookies ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
COOKIE_SECURE=                      # Required. True in production, False in development
COOKIE_SAMESITE=                    # Required. e.g. lax | strict | none
ACCESS_TOKEN_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=       # Required. e.g. 1800
REFRESH_TOKEN_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=      # Required. e.g. 604800

# ── OAuth (Google) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Only needed if using Google OAuth
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URL=                # e.g. http://localhost:8000/auth/google/callback

# ── Frontend URLs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
FRONTEND_URL=                       # e.g. http://localhost:5173
FRONTEND_OAUTH_SUCCESS=             # e.g. http://localhost:5173/oauth/success
FRONTEND_REDIRECT_URL=              # e.g. http://localhost:5173/dashboard
FRONTEND_RESET_URL=                 # e.g. http://localhost:5173/reset-password

# ── Email ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Only needed if sending emails
MAIL_USERNAME=
MAIL_PASSWORD=
MAIL_FROM=                          # e.g. noreply@yourdomain.com
MAIL_PORT=                          # e.g. 587
MAIL_SERVER=                        # e.g. smtp.gmail.com
MAIL_FROM_NAME=                     # e.g. FMS App

# ── Misc ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NGROK_AUTHTOKEN=                    # Optional. Only needed for local tunnel testing

# ── Storage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CLOUDINARY_URL=                     # Set up cloud storage for files or images storage